'''Madoka Cat & Homura''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 14.1 Update#Version 14.1.1|Version 14.1.1]]. It is an anti-[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Shitakiri Sparrow (Uber Rare Cat)|Shitakiri Sparrow]].

